    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 98 Cedar Square is an impressive two-bedroom top floor corner apartment boasting a sunny Southeast facing balcony overlooking landscaped central courtyard. The accommodation extends to a spacious 76 sq.m. and comprises entrance hall, kitchen/dining room, large dual aspect living room with balcony off, two double bedrooms, master bedroom with en suite and main bathroom. All amenities, including the Swords Express bus route are only minutes from the property. Ridgewood is an award-winning development that enjoys easy access to Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\n* Spacious top floor, dual aspect, corner apartment\r\n* Attic space for storage\r\n* Sunny Southeast facing balcony with private outlook\r\n* Convenient location\r\n* Close to large open green space and children’s playground\r\n* Separate kitchen\r\n* Large dual aspect living room\r\n* Master bedroom with en suite off\r\n* Freshly painted throughout\r\n* Built in wardrobes\r\n* Laminate flooring to the entrance hall and living room\r\n* Tiled floors to bathroom and en suite\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* Double glazed windows\r\n* Only minutes’ walk to Swords Express bus route\r\n* Easy access to Dublin Airport, M1 & M50 motorways\r\n* Annual Service Charge (2026): €2,328.08\r\nManagement Company Agent: Urban Ireland\r\n* Schools close by:\r\nHoly Family Junior & National School\r\nLoreto College Secondary School\r\nColáiste Choilm Secondary School"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance hall   -   Laminate flooring.  Hot press / storage cupboard off. Access hatch to attic space.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room   -   3.0m x 3.4m\r\nFully fitted cream kitchen. Vinyl flooring. Integrated hob and oven. Access hatch to attic.\r\n\r\nLiving room   -   4.4m x 5.2m\r\nLarge bright dual aspect living room with laminate flooring. Southeast facing balcony off. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   3.1m  x 4.5m\r\nDouble room with dual aspect. Built in wardrobes. Carpet fitted. En suite off.\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nEn suite   -   2.3m x 1.5m\r\nWith shower, toilet and wash hand basin. Tiled floor and tiled walls at shower surround. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   3.3m x 3.1m\r\nDouble room with built in wardrobes. Carpet fitted.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   2.0m x m\r\nTiled floor and tiled walls at bath surround. Bath, toilet and wash hand basin. Skylight.\r\n\r\nOutside:\t\t\t\r\nTo the front there is ample communal parking provided. There is a sunny Southeast facing balcony off the living room. Large open green space and children’s playground."
      },
